# What `dart pub publish` leaves out of package:rayo. A .pubignore replaces
# .gitignore for pub, so the build outputs are listed again. The package is
# the Dart library, the C sources its build hook compiles, their headers and
# licences and example/: no docs (pub.dev links them on GitHub), tests,
# tools, converter or C examples.
.dart_tool/
build/
pubspec.lock
*.so
*.o
*.a
__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.github/
.clang-format
.gitattributes
Makefile
convert/
examples/
test/
tests/
tool/
tools/
docs/
